          "walk 30 ft., fly 60 ft."
        ]
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Appearance",
          "lines": [
            "A rideable giant horsefly brought to life from the Ebony Fly figurine."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Senses",
          "lines": [
            "Darkvision 60 ft."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Figurine mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Ebony Fly · This rare wondrous item costs 60,000 gp and becomes a Giant Fly that can carry a rider for up to 12 hours.",
            "Activation · Use an action to speak the command word and throw the figurine at a spot on the ground within 60 ft. The fly appears if the space is clear and large enough.",
            "Commands · The fly is friendly to the user and their companions. It understands the user's languages and follows spoken commands. Without orders, it only defends itself.",
            "Reversion and reuse · The fly reverts when the duration ends, when it drops to 0 HP, or when the user takes an action to say the command word while touching it. Two days must pass after reversion before it can be used again."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Table notes",
          "lines": [
            "Perception 10, Stealth 11. Ability modifiers are Str +2, Dex +1, Con +1, Int −4, Wis +0, Cha −4.",
            "The creature block lists no languages, challenge rating, XP, or actions.",
            "Kobold Press, Black Flag Roleplaying Reference Document v0.2, pp. 97–98."
          ]
        }
      ],
